              "auto-discovered via /client/session-user. DO NOT copy: the "
              "customer-portal page (document) request, the access-token "
              "request, or anything under customer-kmd2/ — ingest refuses "
              "non-PAS requests. Re-paste whenever `emta doctor` reports "
